{"title":"1998 IMO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution(In_Chinese)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution(In Chinese)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Flammable_Maths\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Flammable Maths</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine all pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/e/28e24c43456d95b5ab8d4f2f8f85a644e98b7ed3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> of positive integers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/f/b4fe488d0d877803dd4643da5a948e63c5dea9d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab^{2} + b + 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"16\" /> divides\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/4/0e476210d1de1d221dca78f6100ceef71f567977.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{2}b + a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"87\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Video_Solution.28In_Chinese.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution(In_Chinese)\">Video Solution(In Chinese)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution(In Chinese)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/TAfXdhndY5M\">https://youtu.be/TAfXdhndY5M</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We use the division algorithm to obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/1/611dcb18e07ee0b61757ae9df237ff56d2c831e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab^2+b+7 \\mid 7a-b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"159\" height=\"21\" />\nHere <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/6/d866c37da5af6c844a5fab213ff360a9ebfe9f68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7a-b^2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"18\" /> is a solution of the original statement, possible when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/f/cdfbb787704efdc04f17807e0de576888fe47db1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=7k^2$\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/0/fe0788587ab2699dfb2a9f2fd2e2fa7aae40ae59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=7k$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is any natural number. This is easily verified.\n</p><p>Otherwise we obtain the inequality (by basic properties of divisiblity):\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/9/569eeabdd93e2644b5356ed739023a3995a0212b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7a-b^2 \\geq ab^2+b+7 \\implies 7a+7-ab^2-b^2 \\geq b+14 \\implies (7-b^2)(a+1) \\geq b+14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"663\" height=\"21\" />\nSo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/b/e0b01caae8f971d2341b5cf90acfc5976818fadb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7-b^2 \\geq 0 \\implies b=1,2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"190\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Testing for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/5/cf590e9abb33aa9776ddc386b1ba6ee7b43fa413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/f/cbf0fb48c349f77944b92320fd64492d6c8b1888.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+8 \\mid 7a-1 \\implies a+8 \\mid 57$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"232\" height=\"20\" />\nTherefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/b/84b4a5403d3ac5b78fd1bcd6ef2ace054a0aa35e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=11, 49$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"17\" />, and we can easily check these.\n</p><p>Testing for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d65baaf9671227780dd04ab952911036aa5c868.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> and applying the division algorithm we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/0/7e0a913fa052ca93543d406c0844f2d7cba5f9f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a+9 \\mid 79$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"85\" height=\"20\" />, having no solutions in natural <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. \n</p><p>Hence, the only solutions are:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/4/544c74942a2d0b85c97abaaa75ae5f748caa8606.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b) = (11, 1), (49,1), (7k^2, 7k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"249\" height=\"21\" /> for all natural <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Written by dabab_kebab\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Flammable_Maths\">Video Solution by Flammable Maths</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Flammable Maths\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MjyJzQeX6ec\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MjyJzQeX6ec</a>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO\" title=\"1998 IMO\">1998 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1998 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1998 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1998 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1998 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1998 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017191916\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 128/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 894/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3290/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.518      1 Template:IMO_box\n100.00%    6.518      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:14121:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017191916 and revision id 291142. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}